Revision history for Game-Checkers

0.04    2026-10-13
	- Add options, the fields a launcher offers before a game
	- The keys, the screen and the move picker are Game::Terminal::Kit's
	- Requires perl 5.14
	- An unset NO_COLOR or an empty one leaves colour on; any other value turns it off
	- to_pdn and from_pdn carry a resignation, an agreed draw and a standing draw offer
	- Add u and r, undo and redo, through Game::Terminal::Kit::History

0.03    2026-10-11
	- Add Game::Checkers::Terminal->run(@argv), which returns the exit status

0.02    2026-10-06
	- Pick a move with the arrow keys, not by typing it, in the terminal.
	- The terminal board is checkered when colour is on.
	- Fix: t/18 needed a Unix shell.
	- Fix: bin/checkers died under Devel::Hook before 0.011.
	- Fix: ambiguous negated constants in Bot.pm.

0.01    2026-09-15
	- First version
